### List products (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### Get one product — seeded id 1 (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

### Create a product (201 + Location)
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test mug",
  "priceCents": 1500,
  "stock": 5
}

### Update a product — replace 4 with the id from the create response (204)
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test mug v2",
  "priceCents": 1800,
  "stock": 3
}

### Create with invalid input — expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "priceCents": -5,
  "stock": 0
}

### Update with invalid input — expect 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "priceCents": -1,
  "stock": 0
}

### List products — default paging (page 0, size 20)
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### List products — request 500 items, should be capped to 100
GET http://localhost:8080/products?size=500

### Get missing product — expect 404 with problem-details
GET http://localhost:8080/products/999

### Validation error — expect 400 with field errors
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "priceCents": -5,
  "stock": 0
}

### Get existing product — expect 200 (control)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1



### 404 — product missing
GET http://localhost:8080/products/999

### 400 — validation (blank name, negative price)
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"","priceCents":-5,"stock":0}

### 200 — control (existing product)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

### 400 — same request body, different fields
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"A valid name","priceCents":100,"stock":-1}